id ussr
name USSR
appeared 2026
creators Ted Smart
tags pl shell
isOpenSource true
description USSR (Unified Shell Script REPL) is a general-purpose, multi-paradigm interpreted shell scripting language featuring a unique grammar resembling TCL and Conventional Commits. It is designed to work efficiently with low-quality code en masse and was partially AI-designed using ChatGPT.
website https://github.com/notlibrary/USSR
fileExtensions su
repository website https://github.com/notlibrary/USSR

githubRepo website https://github.com/notlibrary/USSR
 firstCommit 2026
 stars 3
 forks 0

example
 # USSR first program
 init(z): arg_cnt arg_vec [
 
 set(name): "USSR"
 set(a): 10
 set(b): 20
 
 add(result): a b
 
 print(output): name
 print(output2): result
 ]
 
